      "html": "<section class=\"ds-route\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-route-title\"><div class=\"ds-route-intro\"><h2 id=\"ds-route-title\">从零构建 Coding Agent</h2><p>从一个最小循环，到可以运行、测试和继续演进的 mini Claude Code。</p><a href=\"#ds-route-title\">学习路线 · 9 篇 →</a></div><ol class=\"ds-chapters\"><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">01</span><span>Agent Loop</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">02</span><span>上下文工程</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">03</span><span>工具与 MCP</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">04</span><span>核心骨架</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">05</span><span>安全与记忆</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">06</span><span>规划与测试</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">07</span><span>架构对照</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">08</span><span>Claude Code 源码</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#ds-route-title\"><span class=\"ds-number\">09</span><span>综合实战</span></a></li></ol></section>",
      "css": ".ds-route{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px;background:var(--entry,rgb(255,255,255));color:var(--primary,#1a1b1c);border:1px solid var(--cat-border,#d0d9e3);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;font-family:var(--font-body, 'Noto Sans SC', 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif)}.ds-route h2{font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:12em}.ds-route p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--secondary,#666);margin:0 0 18px}.ds-route-intro>a{font-size:13px;color:var(--cat-blue,#366593);text-decoration:none}.ds-chapters{display:grid;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;gap:1px}.ds-chapters a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:4px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.ds-chapters a:hover{background:var(--cat-wash,#e8eff6)}.ds-number{color:var(--cat-blue,#366593);font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-route a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--cat-blue,#366593);outline-offset:-2px;border-radius:5px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-route{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20px;gap:18px}.ds-route h2{max-width:none;font-size:20px}.ds-route p{margin-bottom:10px}.ds-chapters{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}.ds-chapters a{padding:5px 0;gap:8px}}"
    },
    {
